5664:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  * The passive idle task.
5665:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  * ----------------------------------------------------------
5666:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  *
5667:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  * The passive idle task is used for all the additional cores in a SMP
5668:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  * system. There must be only 1 active idle task and the rest are passive
5669:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  * idle tasks.
5670:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  *
5671:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  * The portTASK_FUNCTION() macro is used to allow port/compiler specific
5672:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  * language extensions.  The equivalent prototype for this function is:
5673:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  *
5674:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  * void prvPassiveIdleTask( void *pvParameters );
5675:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****  */
5676:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c **** 
5677:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c **** #if ( configNUMBER_OF_CORES > 1 )
5678:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/tasks.c ****     static portTASK_FUNCTION( prvPassiveIdleTask, pvParameters )
